+; Similar to rounder_0 in MMX code
+; 4 first similar, then: 4*8->6*16  5*8->4*16  6/7*8->5*16
+walkenIdctRounders: times 4 dd 65536
+                    times 4 dd  3597
+                    times 4 dd  2260
+                    times 4 dd  1203
+                    times 4 dd   120
+                    times 4 dd   512
+                    times 2 dd     0
+
+pb_127: times 8 db 127
